+    *   Method B: $AO = \frac{O}{d_{max} \cdot N_{samples} \cdot 4.0}$ [S3, unofficial].
+    *   Method C: $AO = \text{clamp}(1.0 - 3.0 \cdot O \cdot u_{ao}, 0.0, 1.0)$ where $u_{ao}$ is a user-defined strength multiplier [S4, unofficial].
 
